**Disaster Mapping Preparedness and Response in Bobonaro** focuses on creating accurate and up-to-date geospatial data for the Bobonaro municipality in Timor-Leste. This project aims to enhance disaster preparedness and response by identifying flood-prone areas, critical infrastructure, and vulnerable communities, supporting better planning and timely interventions.

- We'll be continuing to help OSM users in TL, especially in data quality assurance to contribute data in this project with good and sustainability;
- We'll provide data analysis training using this data to evaluate how much infrastructure was affected by the flood and which road will be used during flood evacuation and planning.

For this project, we want to help World Vision Timor-Leste to digitizing all infrastructure in the program area of Covalima.

1. We'll be continuing to help OSM users in TL, especially in data quality assurance to contribute data in this project with good and sustainability;
2. We'll provide data analysis training using this data to evaluate how much infrastructure was affected by the flood and which road will be used during flood evacuation and planning.
